  "title": "Canada Challenges Russia’s Nuclear Influence in Turkey With Proposed 4.5-Gigawatt Power Plant",
  "deck": "Canadian nuclear technology could provide Turkey with an alternative to Russian-built reactors as Ankara seeks to expand its energy infrastructure and diversify its international partnerships.",
